WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.775
Put in x, work out y, then write the pair, with x first.

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.255
The rule is y equals three x minus one; choose the input zero.

3
00:00:10.106 --> 00:00:15.306
Put zero in place of x: three times zero, minus one, is negative one.

4
00:00:16.136 --> 00:00:19.636
The pair is zero, negative one, with the input first.

5
00:00:21.793 --> 00:00:25.868
An input of one gives two; every input gets its own output.

6
00:00:29.143 --> 00:00:33.718
This is the table of values, with inputs on top and outputs underneath.
